-- title:
--   Public permutation sampling and affine output encoding
-- statement:
--   These programs draw finite tickets, arrays, permutations, and public control seeds, then assemble an integer affine map from its loads, roots, offsets, and columns. The resulting matrix and offset are serialized in the platform binary encoding. The package also supplies local coefficient and tensor routines used in the later sampler stages.
-- source:
--   Companion Lean implementation for the fixed-family Gaussian affine transport theorem. The source modules and their SHA-256 hashes are recorded in the checked extraction manifest. This exact generated file has SHA-256 be89145caff3bead5f62e3fa6be06063537c4277eccd458aef21af15f0e5bd32. Source modules: Integration9_9_TM2NativeTicketDraw, Integration9_9_TM2NativePositiveDraw, Integration9_9_TM2NativeArrayDraw, Integration9_9_TM2NativePermutationRows, Integration9_9_TM2NativePermutationDraw, Integration9_9_TM2NativeReferenceDraw, Integration9_9_TM2NativePublicSeed, Integration9_9_TM2NativeCoreProposal, Integration9_9_TM2NativeCoreCharge, Integration9_9_TM2NativeEmitterCoordinates, Integration9_9_TM2NativeEmitterLoads, Integration9_9_TM2NativeEmitterRoots, Integration9_9_TM2NativeEmitterOffset, Integration9_9_TM2NativeEmitterColumns, Integration9_9_TM2NativeEmitterData, Integration9_9_TM2NativeEmitterAssembly, Integration9_9_TM2NativeEmitter, Integration9_9_TM2NativeEmitterOutput, Integration9_9_TM2PlatformSerialization, Solutions_AdvantageBridgeEncoding, Integration9_9_TM2NativeAffineEmitter, Integration9_9_TM2NativeLocalPair, Integration9_9_TM2NativeRootGroupMass, Integration9_9_TM2NativeTensorInverse, Integration9_9_TM2NativeRootGroupCoefficient, Integration9_9_TM2NativeBackgroundDiffuse. Alternate sparse native dependencies preserve the original non-import body bytes and all public types; this header-only packaging is recorded in sparse_live/manifest.json. Current source SHA256 f4154a4c55f4be87fa1e6486cb7d45acb48fc226506ed56b04f6d31c760c4454. Native10/11 split fallback keeps every original scope-closed data body unchanged and retains the canonical module names as import facades. Current source SHA256 f4154a4c55f4be87fa1e6486cb7d45acb48fc226506ed56b04f6d31c760c4454.

